  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 15 - 24 + 63 ÷ 7 × 2 = 9 .\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 63 and 24\n\nGiven: 15 - 24 + 63 ÷ 7 × 2 = 9 \n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 15 - 63 + __**24 ÷ 7**__ × 2 = 9 \n\n⇒ 15 - 63 + __**3.42 × 2**__ = 9 \n\n⇒ __**15**__ - 63 __**+ 6.84**__ = 9 \n\n⇒ __21.84 - 63__ = 9\n\n⇒ -41.16 ≠ 9\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 7 and 63\n\nGiven: 15 - 24 + 63 ÷ 7 × 2 = 9 \n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 15 - 24 + __**7 ÷ 63**__ × 2 = 9 \n\n⇒ 15 - 24 + __**0.11 × 2**__ = 9 \n\n⇒ __**15**__ - 24 __**+ 0.22**__ = 9 \n\n⇒ __15.22 -____ 24__ = 9\n\n⇒ -8.78 ≠ 9\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 63 and 9\n\nGiven: 15 - 24 + 63 ÷ 7 × 2 = 9 \n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 15 - 24 + __**9 ÷ 7**__ × 2 = 63\n\n⇒ 15 - 24 + __**1.28 × 2**__ = 63\n\n⇒ __**15**__ - 24 __**+ 2.56**__ = 63\n\n⇒ __17.56 - 24__ = 63\n\n⇒ -6.44 ≠ 63\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) 24 and 9**\n\nGiven: 15 - 24 + 63 ÷ 7 × 2 = 9 \n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 15 - 9 + __**63 ÷ 7**__ × 2 = 24 \n\n⇒ 15 - 9 + __**9 × 2**__ = 24 \n\n⇒ __**15**__ - 9 __**+ 18**__ = 24 \n\n⇒ __33 - 9__ = 24\n\n**⇒ 24 = 24**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
